10 REM STRUCTURED ENTERPRISE HELLO WORLD LOOP (DIJKSTRA-INSPIRED, NO GOTO)
20 ON ERROR GOSUB 1900
30 GOSUB 1000
40 GOSUB 3000
50 GOTO 40
1000 REM INITIALIZE PROGRAM STATE
1005 OTELSPAN "hello-world-initialize"
1010 MESSAGE$ = "HELLO WORLD"
1020 ITERATION% = 0
1025 OTELEND
1030 RETURN
1900 REM RECOVER MESSAGE AFTER RUNTIME ERROR
1905 OTELSPAN "hello-world-recover"
1910 MESSAGE$ = "HELLO WORLD"
1915 OTELLOG "ERROR RECOVERED: MESSAGE$ RESTORED TO HELLO WORLD"
1917 OTELEND
1920 RESUME NEXT
2000 REM EXECUTE ONE LOOP ITERATION
2005 OTELSPAN "hello-world-iteration"
2010 GOSUB 2100
2020 GOSUB 2200
2030 GOSUB 2300
2035 OTELCOUNT "hello.world.iterations"
2038 OTELEND
2040 RETURN
2100 REM GUARD MESSAGE INVARIANT
2105 OTELSPAN "hello-world-guard"
2110 IF LEN(MESSAGE$) = 0 THEN MESSAGE$ = "HELLO WORLD"
2115 OTELEND
2120 RETURN
2200 REM PRINT CURRENT ITERATION
2205 OTELSPAN "hello-world-print"
2210 PRINT ITERATION%; " "; MESSAGE$
2215 OTELEND
2220 RETURN
2300 REM ADVANCE AND WRAP ITERATION COUNTER
2305 OTELSPAN "hello-world-advance"
2310 ITERATION% = ITERATION% + 1
2320 IF ITERATION% > 9999 THEN ITERATION% = 0
2325 OTELEND
2330 RETURN
3000 REM LOOP DRIVER (STRUCTURED, NO GOTO)
3010 GOSUB 2000
3020 RETURN
